    "Name": "Dagoth",
    "Details": "With the DG-A-1 proving a surprise success, VEST rolled out the DG-P-7 as a stripped-down export for cash-strapped Periphery states. A Gauss rifle, single LRM-10, and twin Large Lasers replace the pricier pulse laser and MML loadout, trading finesse for parts any backwater 'Mech bay can keep running. The trademark shield was kept due to its usefulness in garrison duties.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Well Balanced</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>",
